From a167e22def86c80eb0ba9e8c26c81b68a815d347 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: lmchilton <lauren.chilton26@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 8 Aug 2025 17:09:45 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] pcp-atop: failure of cpu stat accumulation

fixes failure of thread cpu utilization
accumulation. Fix includes sorting processes
based on thread ID and accumulation of cpu
stats into the 'parent' process; where
parent process is defined by PID=TGID

resolves RHEL-79767

includes two updated QA out files
{1748 & 1978} that now account for
new CPU accumulated data
---
 qa/1748.out              | 2458 +++++++++++++++++++-------------------
 qa/1978.out              |  542 ++++-----
 src/pcp/atop/photoproc.c |   66 +
 3 files changed, 1518 insertions(+), 1548 deletions(-)

